1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"letter-cascade is-in","aria-label":"thinking.haus","children":[["$","b","t-0",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":0},"children":"t"}],["$","b","h-1",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":1},"children":"h"}],["$","b","i-2",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":2},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-3",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":3},"children":"n"}],["$","b","k-4",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":4},"children":"k"}],["$","b","i-5",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":5},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-6",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":6},"children":"n"}],["$","b","g-7",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":7},"children":"g"}],["$","b",".-8",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":8},"children":"."}],["$","b","h-9",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":9},"children":"h"}],["$","b","a-10",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":10},"children":"a"}],["$","b","u-11",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":11},"children":"u"}],["$","b","s-12",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":12},"children":"s"}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","data-content-slug":"ai","data-content-title":"AI","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"AI"}],null,null,["$","p",null,{"className":"author-edit-action","hidden":true,"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://thinkinghaus-studio.maxpfennighaus.workers.dev/","children":"Edit"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-I use AI throughout thinking.haus.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["I use AI throughout thinking.haus."]}],["$","p","1-I use it to think out loud, interrogate half-formed ideas, research unfamiliar territory, make unlikely connections, argue with myself, edit, revise, and keep following a thought after I might otherwise have dropped it.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["I use it to think out loud, interrogate half-formed ideas, research unfamiliar territory, make unlikely connections, argue with myself, edit, revise, and keep following a thought after I might otherwise have dropped it."]}],["$","p","2-It sometimes contributes words. It often contributes questions. I discard a lot. I rewrite a lot. The work that remains is here because I recognize myself in it and am willing to put my name on it.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["It sometimes contributes words. It often contributes questions. I discard a lot. I rewrite a lot. The work that remains is here because I recognize myself in it and am willing to put my name on it."]}],["$","p","3-Working this way has made me less interested in whether something was *made with AI* than in what kind of attention went into making it. A tool can participate deeply in the process without replacing the person responsible for the choices.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Working this way has made me less interested in whether something was ",["$","em","1",{"children":["made with AI"]}]," than in what kind of attention went into making it. A tool can participate deeply in the process without replacing the person responsible for the choices."]}],["$","p","4-For me, AI has become a way of making thinking visible. The conversation forces ideas out of their comfortable vagueness and into language, where I can finally see what I believe, what I don’t, and what deserves another pass.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["For me, AI has become a way of making thinking visible. The conversation forces ideas out of their comfortable vagueness and into language, where I can finally see what I believe, what I don’t, and what deserves another pass."]}],"$Le","$Lf"],null,null]}],null,"$L10"]}]]}]}]
